From b2b6db32e31168115c29d3fe560eeb8893f6ca63 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 09:55:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(payroll): pay approved overtime via tenant-configured
 multiplier (engine 0.4.0)

- overtime.ts: pure calculator; multiplier is tenant policy, never assumed
- calculateRun: add approved overtime to gross and statutory base; stamp engine_version on recalculation
- blocking warnings when policy/pay basis cannot support payment; timesheet-excess review warning
- payslip overtime line
- GET/PATCH /compliance/overtime-policy (jsonb merge, audited)
- unit + real-PostgreSQL integration tests; docs/16 updated
